WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.460
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:02.500 --> 00:04.460
<b>New Dictionary</b>

00:02.500 --> 00:04.460
<b>Third Edition</b>

00:04.710 --> 00:08.000
<b>The Hero Club has been going too far
with their antics recently.</b>

00:08.460 --> 00:09.710
<b>True.</b>

00:11.000 --> 00:13.460
<b>Problems With the Hero Club's Activities</b>

00:11.000 --> 00:13.460
<b>President</b>

00:13.630 --> 00:17.460
<b>Swimming in irrigation channels, ganging up
and following a girl around town,</b>

00:17.460 --> 00:19.170
<b>creating public disturbance...</b>

00:19.170 --> 00:21.830
<b>Though the cooking class incident
was apparently an accident.</b>

00:22.540 --> 00:24.460
<b>Vice President                                   Secretary</b>

00:22.830 --> 00:25.130
<b>Being rowdy in the school is one thing.</b>

00:25.460 --> 00:29.540
<b>But causing trouble for people outside
of school isn't acceptable.</b>

00:29.830 --> 00:35.170
<b>And we did see them causing a disturbance
at Amazing Land with our own eyes.</b>

00:36.000 --> 00:37.920
<b>What should we do, President?</b>

00:41.580 --> 00:45.000
<b>Calm and</b>

00:41.580 --> 00:45.000
<b>collected</b>

00:42.170 --> 00:44.330
<b>Let's observe them for a while.</b>

01:00.290 --> 01:02.710
<b>Sousa ore wa mezamete shimatta</b>

01:02.710 --> 01:05.540
<b>Tokubetsu na chikara motte shimatta</b>

01:05.540 --> 01:07.710
<b>Kono barrier no maeni wa</b>

01:07.710 --> 01:12.170
<b>Donna yatsura mo muryoku daze</b>

01:15.250 --> 01:17.960
<b>Tenshi ka akuma no umarekawari ka</b>

01:17.960 --> 01:20.750
<b>Mienai mono ga miete shimaunda</b>

01:20.750 --> 01:22.960
<b>Migiude ga uzukidashita</b>

01:22.960 --> 01:25.330
<b>Kakusei no toki wa mada hayai</b>

01:25.460 --> 01:28.130
<b>Kodomo janaisi otona demo nai</b>

01:28.130 --> 01:30.460
<b>Tetsugaku pierce buchi akete</b>

01:30.460 --> 01:34.250
<b>Kashiore karaage lemon o kaketara saa!</b>

01:34.540 --> 01:36.830
<b>(Nonde nonde nonde nonde)</b>

01:37.000 --> 01:39.330
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

01:39.330 --> 01:41.830
<b>Kodoku to herikutsu no yami ni magirete</b>

01:41.830 --> 01:44.460
<b>Tokkouyaku wa mitsukaranai</b>

01:44.460 --> 01:46.830
<b>Otoko ni umareta shukumei dakara</b>

01:46.830 --> 01:49.630
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

01:49.630 --> 01:52.130
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

01:52.130 --> 01:54.540
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

01:54.540 --> 01:57.000
<b>Risou to genjitsu no hazama de yureteru</b>

01:57.000 --> 01:59.580
<b>Kaiketsusaku wa miataranai</b>

01:59.580 --> 02:02.130
<b>Setsuna o musaboru unmei naraba</b>

02:02.130 --> 02:04.750
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

02:04.920 --> 02:07.250
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

02:07.250 --> 02:09.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

02:15.790 --> 02:18.540
<b>Episode 6</b>

02:15.790 --> 02:18.540
<b>I Sense Someone Glancing This Way</b>

02:19.880 --> 02:20.580
<b>Please press</b>

02:19.880 --> 02:20.580
<b>for assistance.</b>

02:21.420 --> 02:22.960
<b>Whoever's next can come in.</b>

02:23.500 --> 02:25.420
<b>Protein</b>

02:31.250 --> 02:34.830
<b>Drink. It's green holy water, grün elixier.</b>

02:32.130 --> 02:36.000
<b>Holy Water</b>

02:34.830 --> 02:36.040
<b>Uh, "gru"...?</b>

02:36.460 --> 02:37.830
<b>He says it's green tea.</b>

02:37.830 --> 02:41.880
<b>Come on. Drink, drink, drink, drink it up!</b>

02:41.880 --> 02:43.420
<b>Oh, you're right. It's good.</b>

02:43.420 --> 02:44.670
<b>Of course it is.</b>

02:44.920 --> 02:48.210
<b>Now speak up. What is it you desire?</b>

02:48.210 --> 02:52.670
<b>Well, we need some help in the bread-snatching race
for the upcoming Sports Day.</b>

02:54.710 --> 02:58.710
<b>We never turn down a request from someone in need.
That's the Hero Club!</b>

02:58.710 --> 03:00.170
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

03:00.500 --> 03:01.880
<b>Who's next?</b>

03:02.290 --> 03:03.670
<b>That's great!</b>

03:02.920 --> 03:06.130
<b>Hero</b>

03:02.920 --> 03:06.130
<b>Club</b>

03:02.920 --> 03:06.130
<b>Room</b>

03:03.670 --> 03:05.330
<b>What a relief.</b>

03:06.880 --> 03:09.000
<b>Finally, we're done!</b>

03:09.000 --> 03:11.460
<b>Who thought we'd be asked to help out
on Sports Day so much?</b>

03:11.920 --> 03:13.960
<b>Pink, Yellow, Black...</b>

03:14.130 --> 03:15.670
<b>Purple, Green!</b>

03:16.130 --> 03:19.420
<b>We may be up against each other depending
on the time and circumstance,</b>

03:19.420 --> 03:20.960
<b>but let's do our best, fair and square!</b>

03:20.960 --> 03:22.920
<b>I told you, I'm not Pink!</b>

03:22.920 --> 03:26.830
<b>Besides, I don't really know
what kind of events there'll be.</b>

03:26.830 --> 03:27.710
<b>Here you go.</b>

03:27.080 --> 03:27.920
<b>Minakami High School</b>

03:27.080 --> 03:27.920
<b>Sports Day</b>

03:27.090 --> 03:27.920
<b>Program</b>

03:29.040 --> 03:31.130
<b>The "Fight it out! 100-meter dash."</b>

03:31.130 --> 03:34.000
<b>The "Don't sweat it! Up, down, all around race."</b>

03:34.000 --> 03:36.380
<b>The "Fire up and let fly! Beanbag toss."</b>

03:36.380 --> 03:37.960
<b>What's with these pushy titles?</b>

03:38.130 --> 03:40.830
<b>What about the "Let 'er rip! Tug of war"?</b>

03:40.830 --> 03:42.750
<b>Why would you rip the rope?!</b>

03:43.080 --> 03:45.880
<b>Not bad. That's some crazy naming.</b>

03:46.170 --> 03:48.960
<b>Isn't it? I came up with all of them!</b>

03:50.170 --> 03:52.210
<b>Because he's on the Sports Day Committee.</b>

03:52.790 --> 03:56.130
<b>Noda-kun, is there something weird
going on with you today?</b>

03:56.330 --> 03:58.250
<b>I'm the same as always.</b>

04:00.080 --> 04:02.500
<b>You usually gesture a lot more, don't you?</b>

04:02.500 --> 04:04.750
<b>But today, you've had your arms crossed the whole-</b>

04:05.920 --> 04:06.750
<b>Uh?!</b>

04:08.460 --> 04:11.130
<b>You've been sitting on nothing?! Since when?!</b>

04:11.130 --> 04:12.380
<b>From the beginning!</b>

04:12.830 --> 04:14.130
<b>"The beginning"?</b>

04:14.460 --> 04:16.710
<b>Since when the first client came.</b>

04:20.040 --> 04:21.170
<b>What'cha think?</b>

04:21.580 --> 04:24.960
<b>You mean to say his Sports Day has already begun?!</b>

04:25.710 --> 04:30.000
<b>What you all need to prepare for is
the Cavalry Battle that's mandatory for the boys!</b>

04:30.330 --> 04:32.710
<b>So we'll train using these!</b>

04:34.920 --> 04:37.040
<b>Train with these? How?</b>

04:37.880 --> 04:40.290
<b>Be careful handling Thor's Hammer!</b>

04:40.420 --> 04:43.710
<b>The important thing is to seize
your opponent's headband quickly.</b>

04:43.880 --> 04:48.420
<b>You need to train your eye to assess the situation
in an instant, as well as your arm movement.</b>

04:49.080 --> 04:50.290
<b>What he said.</b>

04:50.290 --> 04:51.580
<b>Huh!</b>

04:53.080 --> 04:56.210
<b>Think your returnee ass can handle this, Futaba?</b>

04:56.210 --> 04:58.670
<b>Ha! I'll show you what I can do.</b>

05:00.630 --> 05:03.210
<b>First comes rock!</b>

05:04.500 --> 05:06.170
<b>Rock, paper scissors...</b>

05:06.460 --> 05:07.210
<b>...shoot.</b>

05:08.920 --> 05:13.670
<b>Oh?! For some reason, Mikuriya grabs
the helmet first even though Tsukumo lost, and...</b>

05:08.920 --> 05:13.670
<b>Note: Winner tries to hit loser's head with hammer.</b>

05:08.920 --> 05:13.670
<b>Loser blocks with helmet.</b>

05:13.670 --> 05:14.880
<b>doesn't put it on?!</b>

05:15.040 --> 05:16.330
<b>He put it on his face?!</b>

05:18.920 --> 05:21.830
<b>If you don't know the rules, you should just ask, Futaba.</b>

05:23.290 --> 05:24.330
<b>Shut up.</b>

05:25.460 --> 05:27.330
<b>Look Green!</b>

05:27.330 --> 05:29.920
<b>This is how the real thing goes!</b>

05:29.920 --> 05:31.330
<b>What "real thing"?</b>

05:31.540 --> 05:33.830
<b>Next, we train for tug of war!</b>

05:37.080 --> 05:39.330
<b>This is training for tug of war?!</b>

05:39.330 --> 05:41.580
<b>Wh-why do I have to do this, too?</b>

05:41.580 --> 05:43.290
<b>I give up...</b>

05:43.290 --> 05:46.250
<b>Hey. What's this going to do...?</b>

05:47.170 --> 05:48.750
<b>This just trains our lower bodies.</b>

05:48.750 --> 05:52.830
<b>To win at tug of war, you have
to dig in with lower body strength!</b>

05:53.130 --> 05:57.250
<b>But did we get any requests for helping
with the "Let 'er rip! Tug of war" event?</b>

05:58.630 --> 05:59.880
<b>Nope!</b>

06:04.580 --> 06:05.830
<b>Are you kidding me?!</b>

06:06.290 --> 06:11.630
<b>The event doesn't matter. If we're going all out
in all our events, we've got to train everything!</b>

06:12.130 --> 06:17.130
<b>Oh, right. There was something called the
"Don't sweat it! Up, down, all around race"...</b>

06:17.420 --> 06:21.710
<b>Probably a cross between an obstacle course
and a borrowed item race?</b>

06:21.710 --> 06:24.130
<b>Yamato, Ryushoin, and Mikuriya are in that.</b>

06:24.130 --> 06:27.630
<b>That'll be child's play using my summoning magic.</b>

06:28.000 --> 06:32.130
<b>Other than that, the "Go get 'em! Bread-snatching race"
will have Takashima and Futaba.</b>

06:32.130 --> 06:33.460
<b>Bread, huh?</b>

06:34.000 --> 06:36.170
<b>If the bread tastes bad I'll forfeit.</b>

06:36.540 --> 06:40.170
<b>We've taken full measures to ensure our victory.</b>

06:40.170 --> 06:42.080
<b>Noda-kun, that bread...</b>

06:42.080 --> 06:44.540
<b>Yeah? You all want some, too?</b>

06:44.540 --> 06:46.670
<b>Don't tell me that's part of training?</b>

06:46.920 --> 06:48.830
<b>Nope, it's a snack!</b>

06:49.790 --> 06:50.540
<b>See you!</b>

06:50.540 --> 06:51.420
<b>Bye!</b>

06:51.920 --> 06:52.830
<b>A one, two...</b>

06:52.830 --> 06:53.790
<b>What's going on?</b>

06:54.170 --> 06:55.670
<b>...three, four....</b>

06:54.330 --> 06:56.290
<b>Why are we meeting at the gate?</b>

06:56.290 --> 07:00.540
<b>The "Fight it out! 100-meter dash" will have me,
Black, Purple, and Green!</b>

07:00.790 --> 07:04.250
<b>Guess its time for the world to notice my talent!</b>

07:04.250 --> 07:07.040
<b>Whatever. Aren't we going home already?</b>

07:07.630 --> 07:09.080
<b>Are you ready?!</b>

07:09.380 --> 07:10.790
<b>What do you intend to do?</b>

07:13.040 --> 07:15.000
<b>We're all running home!</b>

07:15.000 --> 07:16.250
<b>What?</b>

07:16.250 --> 07:17.330
<b>I knew it!</b>

07:24.380 --> 07:26.830
<b>At it as usual, eh?</b>

07:26.830 --> 07:31.130
<b>Like I said, why do I have to run, too?!</b>

07:31.540 --> 07:33.960
<b>You can't win without the hard work!</b>

07:33.960 --> 07:36.170
<b>Hero Club, let's do this!</b>

07:36.580 --> 07:37.920
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:38.170 --> 07:40.380
<b>Hello? Let's do this!</b>

07:40.380 --> 07:41.920
<b>Yeah...</b>

07:46.710 --> 07:48.170
<b>Minakami</b>

07:46.710 --> 07:48.170
<b>High School</b>

07:46.710 --> 07:48.170
<b>Sports Day</b>

07:48.380 --> 07:49.420
<b>Red Team!</b>

07:50.290 --> 07:51.460
<b>Awaken...!</b>

07:52.210 --> 07:55.170
<b>Red Team!</b>

07:52.210 --> 07:55.170
<b>Awaken,</b>

07:52.210 --> 07:55.170
<b>warriors of fire</b>

07:52.580 --> 07:54.580
<b>...warriors of fire!</b>

07:55.420 --> 07:58.210
<b>The writing's nice and powerful, huh?</b>

07:58.500 --> 08:00.130
<b>I wrote it, you know!</b>

08:00.130 --> 08:03.170
<b>Noda-kun did the lettering on the banner, too!</b>

08:03.170 --> 08:04.250
<b>That's amazing.</b>

08:04.250 --> 08:09.210
<b>Go all out! Fire up your soul!</b>

08:05.000 --> 08:07.670
<b>Noda-kun's putting so much work into Sports Day.</b>

08:07.670 --> 08:13.290
<b>The opening ceremony is about to begin.
All students, please come to the athletic field.</b>

08:13.670 --> 08:15.750
<b>This voice... Is that Takashima-kun?</b>

08:16.040 --> 08:18.290
<b>Yellow's on the Student Broadcast Committee.</b>

08:20.250 --> 08:25.920
<b>Let's go! Just be myself, just "I."  </b>

08:20.330 --> 08:22.250
<b>Oh, it's from iLive.</b>

08:25.920 --> 08:30.420
<b>Yes, we want to shine in the now!</b>

08:26.540 --> 08:28.330
<b>Are you a fan too, Mikuriya-kun?</b>

08:28.330 --> 08:29.250
<b>Huh?!</b>

08:29.670 --> 08:30.630
<b>Uh, no...!</b>

08:30.630 --> 08:32.960
<b>Huh? But you just...</b>

08:33.420 --> 08:36.920
<b>Playing the guitar makes my body move without thinking.</b>

08:36.920 --> 08:38.380
<b>I see.</b>

08:39.580 --> 08:41.290
<b>The first event...</b>

08:43.290 --> 08:45.790
<b>...is the "Fight it out! 100-meter dash"!</b>

08:46.290 --> 08:48.000
<b>Come on, Mikuriya-kun!</b>

08:48.000 --> 08:49.170
<b>Go!</b>

08:49.170 --> 08:50.080
<b>You've got this!</b>

08:50.080 --> 08:52.500
<b>How ready are you, Contestant Tsukumo?</b>

08:53.000 --> 08:55.040
<b>I'm pretty confident about my leg power.</b>

08:55.540 --> 08:58.040
<b>Think you can keep up, Futaba?</b>

08:58.500 --> 09:02.040
<b>Whoa?! There goes Contestant Tsukumo talking big!</b>

09:02.630 --> 09:05.000
<b>And how does Contestant Mikuriya respond
to this direct challenge?!</b>

09:05.000 --> 09:08.040
<b>You're only fast when you're running
from something, Rei.</b>

09:08.330 --> 09:10.210
<b>These two are cousins, apparently, but
while the sweet trope of</b>

09:10.210 --> 09:13.630
<b>"cute little sister who always looked up
to her brother turns out to be his cousin</b>

09:13.630 --> 09:16.710
<b>and they could potentially get married
if they wanted" is rampant in fiction,</b>

09:16.710 --> 09:20.830
<b>we have little hope of seeing that
as these two are both guys!</b>

09:24.250 --> 09:26.790
<b>Contestant Sato! How ready are you?</b>

09:26.790 --> 09:29.630
<b>Well, I feel like I've wandered
in somewhere I don't belong...</b>

09:30.170 --> 09:31.290
<b>Contestant Nakamura?</b>

09:31.290 --> 09:33.420
<b>My name's Toga Ryushoin.</b>

09:33.420 --> 09:34.710
<b>And how ready are you?</b>

09:34.710 --> 09:38.080
<b>As I live in darkness, I don't belong in the spotlight.</b>

09:38.540 --> 09:40.670
<b>Yama- Uh, no. Contestant Noda?</b>

09:40.670 --> 09:41.750
<b>I'm gonna win!</b>

09:41.750 --> 09:43.130
<b>Thank you for that...</b>

09:43.960 --> 09:46.750
<b>On your mark, get set...</b>

09:48.830 --> 09:52.830
<b>Go, Purple! Don't fall behind, Black!</b>

09:52.830 --> 09:56.330
<b>Contestant Noda is in the lead!
Such a fast, rocket-speed start!</b>

09:56.330 --> 09:59.460
<b>And coming up in second place...is Contestant Mikuriya-</b>

09:59.460 --> 10:01.830
<b>Mikuriya-kun! You've got this!</b>

10:02.500 --> 10:06.580
<b>Apparently Contestant Mikuriya has been chosen
for the relay every year since elementary school!</b>

10:07.330 --> 10:08.750
<b>D-damn it.</b>

10:09.250 --> 10:11.170
<b>And following in third place...</b>

10:11.170 --> 10:12.170
<b>Tsukumo-kun?</b>

10:13.170 --> 10:13.960
<b>Nope!</b>

10:13.960 --> 10:15.830
<b>Sato-kun's pretty fast, too!</b>

10:16.210 --> 10:17.420
<b>Oh, here he comes!</b>

10:17.420 --> 10:18.750
<b>You can do it!</b>

10:19.130 --> 10:23.130
<b>Huff, huff, whew... Huff, huff, whew...
Huff, huff, whew...</b>

10:23.380 --> 10:25.080
<b>That's pretty average...</b>

10:25.580 --> 10:27.040
<b>First place! Contestant Noda!</b>

10:27.040 --> 10:28.670
<b>Second place! Contestant Mikuriya!</b>

10:28.670 --> 10:30.460
<b>Third place! Contestant Sato!</b>

10:30.880 --> 10:33.330
<b>The placing stayed the same all the way through.</b>

10:33.960 --> 10:36.290
<b>I wonder if Nakamura-kun's okay...</b>

10:36.290 --> 10:37.170
<b>Huh?</b>

10:37.170 --> 10:41.500
<b>He's abysmally slow! Way too slow!</b>

10:43.920 --> 10:44.920
<b>Good work, guys.</b>

10:48.250 --> 10:49.250
<b>Damn it!</b>

10:50.710 --> 10:52.580
<b>If only I hadn't twisted my ankle...!</b>

10:56.000 --> 10:57.710
<b>If I gave it my all...</b>

10:58.500 --> 11:00.130
<b>...these supernatural...</b>

11:00.670 --> 11:01.750
<b>...powers...wou-</b>

11:03.080 --> 11:04.580
<b>It's okay, we get it!</b>

11:04.580 --> 11:06.960
<b>Get your breathing back to normal
before talking, all right?</b>

11:07.290 --> 11:08.580
<b>That was amazing, Yamato!</b>

11:08.580 --> 11:09.170
<b>Yeah!</b>

11:11.420 --> 11:12.670
<b>What's wrong?</b>

11:12.790 --> 11:15.460
<b>No, I just sense someone glancing this way.</b>

11:16.330 --> 11:18.790
<b>Hmm? I don't see anyone.</b>

11:19.460 --> 11:20.630
<b>You sure?</b>

11:27.420 --> 11:29.000
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys.</b>

11:30.830 --> 11:32.670
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

11:34.710 --> 11:36.420
<b>The next event is...</b>

11:36.790 --> 11:40.130
<b>...the "Don't sweat it! Up, down, all around race"!</b>

11:40.460 --> 11:45.460
<b>Basically, it's an obstacle course race infused
with elements of a "borrowed item" race!</b>

11:47.500 --> 11:49.210
<b>Can I borrow someone's glasses?!</b>

11:49.210 --> 11:51.380
<b>Anyone with a banana for a snack?!</b>

11:51.380 --> 11:53.540
<b>A Band Club member! I need a Band Club member!</b>

11:54.330 --> 11:55.330
<b>Right.</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:57.880
<b>Band</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:57.880
<b>Club</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:57.880
<b>member</b>

11:55.790 --> 11:57.920
<b>Guess its time for me to shine.</b>

11:57.920 --> 11:59.670
<b>Come on! Go, go!</b>

12:01.290 --> 12:03.920
<b>No good. Nakamura, you need something red,</b>

12:03.920 --> 12:05.000
<b>Something red</b>

12:04.580 --> 12:06.790
<b>but this is most definitely...blue.</b>

12:07.330 --> 12:08.960
<b>Quiet, imbecile.</b>

12:09.380 --> 12:14.210
<b>Look closely. Faust is descended
from the red crimson phoenix.</b>

12:16.420 --> 12:17.540
<b>Imbecile.</b>

12:18.040 --> 12:19.420
<b>Faust!</b>

12:19.420 --> 12:21.710
<b>Toga Ryushoin!</b>

12:22.790 --> 12:25.080
<b>Second group of runners, get yourselves ready!</b>

12:31.000 --> 12:33.460
<b>The best wind possible is blowing today.</b>

12:37.130 --> 12:38.960
<b>I won't let you beat me, Green!</b>

12:39.920 --> 12:42.830
<b>Don't do that in front of others. It makes me cringe!</b>

12:43.080 --> 12:46.420
<b>On your mark, get set...</b>

12:48.750 --> 12:52.580
<b>Contestants Noda and Mikuriya take
a commanding lead here too, as expected!</b>

12:57.460 --> 13:00.000
<b>Contestant Mikuriya isn't letting
Contestant Noda get away!</b>

13:00.500 --> 13:02.420
<b>Here we enter the "borrowed item" zone!</b>

13:02.420 --> 13:07.500
<b>Up to now, they're pretty much neck and neck,
but Contestant Noda is the first to grab a slip of paper!</b>

13:10.170 --> 13:12.000
<b>Oh? He stopped!</b>

13:12.380 --> 13:14.670
<b>I wonder what's wrong with Noda-kun?</b>

13:15.500 --> 13:17.500
<b>The others are going to catch up!</b>

13:17.790 --> 13:19.000
<b>Noda-kun!</b>

13:21.290 --> 13:22.710
<b>Come on, Pink!</b>

13:23.460 --> 13:25.130
<b>What? Me?!</b>

13:35.500 --> 13:37.170
<b>Right! You pass!</b>

13:40.710 --> 13:42.670
<b>What? What did it say?</b>

13:42.670 --> 13:44.920
<b>"Club member"? "The student sitting next to you"?</b>

13:46.580 --> 13:47.920
<b>Can you keep up?</b>

13:49.210 --> 13:51.630
<b>He's running at my pace...</b>

13:52.000 --> 13:52.960
<b>I'm fine!</b>

13:53.420 --> 13:55.210
<b>Great! Then we'll speed up!</b>

13:55.210 --> 13:55.960
<b>Huh?</b>

13:56.630 --> 14:00.290
<b>Hold on a sec!</b>

14:00.670 --> 14:03.460
<b>Contestant Noda is first place for
the second event in a row!</b>

14:05.670 --> 14:07.500
<b>Congratulations, Contestant Noda!</b>

14:08.170 --> 14:10.790
<b>You seemed stuck there for a while,
but what did you need to find?</b>

14:11.920 --> 14:13.500
<b>My favorite...</b>

14:14.290 --> 14:15.330
<b>Huh?</b>

14:17.960 --> 14:19.710
<b>...name for a person!</b>

14:20.250 --> 14:22.880
<b>Pink's last name "Hijiri" is pretty unusual.</b>

14:23.210 --> 14:26.920
<b>I couldn't decide between her and Purple,
but Pink won by a narrow margin!</b>

14:26.920 --> 14:28.210
<b>Ah.</b>

14:28.210 --> 14:29.210
<b>I should have known!</b>

14:29.670 --> 14:32.710
<b>In second place was Contestant Takahashi, and in third
place was Contestant Morikawa!</b>

14:33.210 --> 14:36.170
<b>Guitar</b>

14:33.630 --> 14:34.830
<b>A guitar, huh?</b>

14:36.830 --> 14:37.920
<b>Damn it!</b>

14:40.750 --> 14:42.670
<b>You're amazing, Tsukumo-kun!</b>

14:43.000 --> 14:44.500
<b>Yeah, they look so good!</b>

14:44.500 --> 14:47.630
<b>I love fried chicken! Can I squeeze some lemon on?</b>

14:48.250 --> 14:51.250
<b>It's true, citric acid is ideal for recovering from fatigue.</b>

14:48.790 --> 14:50.500
<b>Sure, that's fine with me.</b>

14:51.250 --> 14:51.880
<b>Just squeeze it on already.</b>

14:51.880 --> 14:55.630
<b>Lemon is a citrus fruit, hence the term "citric acid."</b>

14:52.580 --> 14:53.960
<b>So tasty!</b>

14:55.630 --> 14:57.000
<b>You dropped something.</b>

14:58.290 --> 15:00.210
<b>This is from the borrowed item race.</b>

15:00.750 --> 15:01.790
<b>"Guitar"?</b>

15:02.420 --> 15:05.000
<b>Mikuriya-kun, don't you always have
your guitar case with you?</b>

15:05.330 --> 15:07.630
<b>Well, your guitar case...</b>

15:07.630 --> 15:08.750
<b>You shut up!</b>

15:08.750 --> 15:09.750
<b>Huh?</b>

15:11.130 --> 15:13.580
<b>The afternoon starts off with individual events!</b>

15:13.580 --> 15:15.040
<b>Good luck to you too, Pink!</b>

15:25.250 --> 15:31.210
<b>Bean</b>

15:25.250 --> 15:31.210
<b>Paste Bun</b>

15:26.210 --> 15:27.920
<b>It's what you've all been waiting for!</b>

15:27.920 --> 15:29.960
<b>The "Go get 'em! Bread-snatching race"!</b>

15:29.960 --> 15:31.290
<b>I'll be competing, too!</b>

15:33.210 --> 15:35.630
<b>On your mark, get set...</b>

15:38.420 --> 15:39.920
<b>Takashima-kun's pretty fast, too!</b>

15:40.920 --> 15:42.420
<b>Go, Pink!</b>

15:42.420 --> 15:44.290
<b>Come on, Mikuriya-kun!</b>

15:47.170 --> 15:48.750
<b>I guess Futaba has the upper hand.</b>

15:48.750 --> 15:50.790
<b>No, Yellow's definitely gonna win!</b>

15:54.420 --> 15:55.540
<b>That was close.</b>

15:56.250 --> 15:57.210
<b>Shit!</b>

16:01.710 --> 16:03.960
<b>Mikuriya-kun's trying so hard!</b>

16:03.960 --> 16:05.630
<b>He's so cute chomping at the air like that!</b>

16:05.630 --> 16:07.500
<b>What a rare shot! I've gotta capture this!</b>

16:07.500 --> 16:09.830
<b>That bastard has the girls all over him.</b>

16:09.830 --> 16:11.710
<b>Yellow! Look closely at the bread!</b>

16:13.920 --> 16:15.710
<b>iLive!</b>

16:13.920 --> 16:15.710
<b>Cream Bun</b>

16:13.920 --> 16:15.710
<b>Rare sticker inside!</b>

16:13.920 --> 16:15.710
<b>15 types in all.</b>

16:13.960 --> 16:15.080
<b>Sora-chan...</b>

16:25.540 --> 16:27.000
<b>Let me hold you...</b>

16:29.710 --> 16:32.130
<b>...in a clever embrace!</b>

16:33.540 --> 16:37.790
<b>That's amazing. What was it about that bread
that triggered Takashima like that?</b>

16:37.790 --> 16:38.790
<b>This.</b>

16:40.080 --> 16:42.540
<b>iLive bread! With a bonus rare card sticker!</b>

16:43.170 --> 16:44.880
<b>Thanks to advice from Black!</b>

16:44.880 --> 16:46.330
<b>Good work, Nakamura!</b>

16:48.500 --> 16:49.500
<b>Damn it!</b>

16:49.960 --> 16:52.080
<b>First place, Tomoki Takashima!</b>

16:56.330 --> 16:58.500
<b>I got Sora-chan!</b>

16:58.500 --> 17:01.540
<b>Total victory! SS rank!</b>

17:02.080 --> 17:03.960
<b>Second place, Futaba Mikuriya.</b>

17:02.210 --> 17:03.540
<b>Yay, yay!</b>

17:07.170 --> 17:11.420
<b>The Minakami School Sports Day's last event is...</b>

17:12.420 --> 17:14.290
<b>...the Calvary Battle!</b>

17:14.500 --> 17:16.290
<b>The Calvary Battle!</b>

17:16.290 --> 17:19.420
<b>But before we do, let's take
a look at how the scores stand!</b>

17:19.420 --> 17:21.380
<b>Red</b>

17:19.960 --> 17:23.170
<b>The red team has 56 points,
the white team has 186 points.</b>

17:21.960 --> 17:26.380
<b>White</b>

17:23.170 --> 17:25.290
<b>The white team has an overwhelming lead!</b>

17:27.670 --> 17:30.420
<b>You mean our red team is losing?!</b>

17:30.420 --> 17:33.420
<b>Well, all the events we helped in were for the white team.</b>

17:33.420 --> 17:35.750
<b>Wh-what did you say?!</b>

17:35.750 --> 17:38.420
<b>He's an idiot... A genuine idiot!</b>

17:38.670 --> 17:41.920
<b>But...I'm not gonna give up!</b>

17:42.920 --> 17:46.830
<b>That's right, you get five times
the points for the Calvary Battle.</b>

17:46.830 --> 17:48.880
<b>I thought you knew that going in.</b>

17:48.880 --> 17:51.920
<b>That's right, everything is going
according to my calculations.</b>

17:51.920 --> 17:53.580
<b>You just pretended like you knew, didn't you?</b>

17:58.040 --> 18:02.630
<b>The rules are simple! Whichever team
gets the most headbands wins!</b>

18:05.330 --> 18:10.460
<b>This murderous tension that makes
my skin tingle... This excitement...!</b>

18:10.880 --> 18:14.960
<b>I'll show you all what Rei Tsukumo,
the fastest rider of them all, can do!</b>

18:15.330 --> 18:17.880
<b>I'll take the lead and defeat their general!</b>

18:19.080 --> 18:21.250
<b>Sora-chan, I'll win this for you!</b>

18:22.580 --> 18:24.380
<b>Are you ready?!</b>

18:24.380 --> 18:26.250
<b>Yeah!</b>

18:28.630 --> 18:30.710
<b>Get pumped up!</b>

18:30.710 --> 18:32.000
<b>Attack!</b>

18:34.040 --> 18:39.250
<b>Let the weaker pawns crush each other first.
Then when I've assessed the situation-</b>

18:39.250 --> 18:41.710
<b>Hey, hey, hey! H-hey. You're going too fast!</b>

18:41.880 --> 18:47.170
<b>Uh, hold on! I'm not ready for this!</b>

18:47.580 --> 18:54.420
<b>Grim, yet ending in the most beautiful way...
The residual image of that unforgettable battle...</b>

18:54.420 --> 18:57.920
<b>Still spouting nonsense, huh, Nakamura?!</b>

19:01.420 --> 19:02.460
<b>You...!</b>

19:03.250 --> 19:05.790
<b>I'll be the one taking your headband!</b>

19:06.000 --> 19:11.630
<b>Poor soul. Yet another warrior tossed
about by ties to a previous life, I see.</b>

19:11.630 --> 19:12.790
<b>What are you saying?</b>

19:14.460 --> 19:16.540
<b>But there's no need to lament.</b>

19:17.000 --> 19:20.790
<b>I, Toga Ryushoin, shall sever
the ties to your previous li-!</b>

19:22.500 --> 19:24.290
<b>Just cut the crap already!</b>

19:45.420 --> 19:46.710
<b>What an idiot!</b>

19:48.460 --> 19:49.460
<b>Huh?</b>

19:50.250 --> 19:52.750
<b>I avenged you, Black!</b>

19:54.170 --> 19:57.460
<b>Time's up! If you got your headband taken,
get off the field!</b>

20:02.880 --> 20:04.960
<b>Noda has a bit more...</b>

20:05.210 --> 20:06.130
<b>Damn it...</b>

20:06.130 --> 20:07.790
<b>...but you're both on the red team.</b>

20:07.790 --> 20:12.170
<b>Which means, for this year's Sports Day,
the red team wins by an overwhelming score!</b>

20:13.710 --> 20:14.580
<b>Not yet!</b>

20:17.540 --> 20:20.540
<b>You're not satisfied yet, are you?</b>

20:21.420 --> 20:22.460
<b>Uh, hey...</b>

20:25.750 --> 20:27.080
<b>The time has come.</b>

20:27.500 --> 20:31.000
<b>Mere human intervention won't
be enough to stop this battle.</b>

20:31.500 --> 20:33.630
<b>A battles of egos, man-to-man!</b>

20:33.920 --> 20:37.750
<b>It isn't like you to lose and leave it at that, Futaba.</b>

20:39.250 --> 20:41.420
<b>You all get on my nerves.</b>

20:42.080 --> 20:42.750
<b>But...</b>

20:44.880 --> 20:47.080
<b>I'll be the one to defeat you!</b>

20:55.380 --> 20:57.130
<b>I'm not holding back, Green!</b>

20:57.130 --> 20:59.250
<b>I'll blast you to the end of the cosmos!</b>

21:06.750 --> 21:10.630
<b>Not bad, Green. I knew there was
something special about you!</b>

21:10.630 --> 21:17.580
<b>That's right. I want to enjoy the kind of gap between
thrill and suspense that makes my soul sting!</b>

21:18.420 --> 21:22.170
<b>Hmm? Mikuriya-kun gets a weird attitude every so often...</b>

21:23.290 --> 21:25.130
<b>Don't tell me you're-?!</b>

21:25.130 --> 21:27.290
<b>Stupid!</b>

21:32.170 --> 21:33.830
<b>Got it!</b>

21:41.460 --> 21:43.080
<b>They're out of control.</b>

21:43.080 --> 21:46.920
<b>So the Hero Club is nothing but
a public disturbance, after all.</b>

21:47.290 --> 21:48.380
<b>What should we do?</b>

21:51.170 --> 21:52.670
<b>The Hero Club...</b>

21:53.040 --> 21:55.960
<b>The last</b>

21:53.040 --> 21:55.960
<b>straw</b>

22:03.920 --> 22:08.580
<b>Azayaka na melody kisetsu no kaze o matoi</b>

22:08.580 --> 22:11.670
<b>Boku o yonderu</b>

22:11.920 --> 22:19.130
<b>Afuredasu rhythm kutsuoto mo kasoku shite</b>

22:19.540 --> 22:27.380
<b>Utsumuiteru dakeja tsukamenai nanika sagashi ni yukou</b>

22:27.540 --> 22:37.630
<b>Donna takai kabe demo kimi to yukunara kitto toberu sa</b>

22:38.040 --> 22:40.330
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.670 --> 22:44.580
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.580 --> 22:47.790
<b>Egaita sono tsubasa de</b>

22:47.790 --> 22:51.580
<b>Keep flying and to story</b>

22:51.830 --> 22:56.460
<b>Ashita o kakeru kara</b>

22:56.460 --> 23:00.580
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.580 --> 23:03.920
<b>Kienai sono kodou wa</b>

23:03.920 --> 23:07.830
<b>Keep trying and to story</b>

23:07.830 --> 23:11.500
<b>Kasanaru harmony</b>

23:11.670 --> 23:17.290
<b>Dare no mono demonai miraizu wa</b>

23:17.670 --> 23:22.670
<b>Kimi to tsuzutteku</b>

23:27.080 --> 23:29.290
<b>You seem like you're enjoying
the club lately, Mizuki-chan!</b>

23:27.460 --> 23:30.000
<b>What fun things will they do next week?</b>

23:29.290 --> 23:31.040
<b>Huh? Not in particular.</b>

23:30.460 --> 23:33.670
<b>Spending time after school with friends is fun, too.</b>

23:31.040 --> 23:32.040
<b>Huh? Really?</b>

23:31.040 --> 23:33.040
<b>Heading home as fast as humanly possible.</b>

23:31.080 --> 23:33.380
<b>I love how free it feels after school.</b>

23:31.500 --> 23:32.790
<b>I've got cram school.</b>

23:31.580 --> 23:32.630
<b>Makeup class...</b>

23:32.040 --> 23:35.580
<b>Well, both the tea Nakamura-kun serves and
the sweets Mikuriya-kun bring are yummy...</b>

23:34.130 --> 23:36.000
<b>I want Nakamura-kun's tea.</b>

23:35.580 --> 23:37.330
<b>Wait. I don't hate it as much anymore?!</b>

23:35.580 --> 23:38.250
<b>Perhaps the sweets are milk strawberry jelly yokan?</b>

23:35.880 --> 23:38.040
<b>Lets all have sweets together!</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:37.790
<b>I want to go home already.</b>

23:36.130 --> 23:38.460
<b>The little nothings make me happy.</b>

23:36.330 --> 23:38.710
<b>Shall we treat ourselves to some afternoon tea...?</b>

23:36.580 --> 23:38.080
<b>Afterschool tea party.</b>

23:37.330 --> 23:40.380
<b>Next episode:
"I'm No Pretty Boy and It's a One Night Stand."</b>
